Specification Include 

# All forms of quotations currently imply the same root directory 
# This will be changed in the future, so just use " " for now

Scenario An include 
Given a string include
""" 
Insert "string.txt"
"""
Then should be equal to 
"""
This is an include string from the main directory
"""
Scenario: An include from base directory 
Given a string include
""" 
Insert 'string.txt'
"""
Then should be equal to 
"""
This is an include string from the main directory
"""


Scenario: An include of CSV file
Given a table : CSVContents
Insert "TestFolder/TableExample.csv"
Then Should be equal to table : CSVContents 
| A | B   | C  |
| a | b,c | d  |
| 1 | 2   | 3  |

Attributes CSVContents 
Description contents
| Name | Type   | Default |
| A    | String |         |
| B    | String |         |
| C    | String |         |


